      169.77,
      225.29,
      393.93,
      236.63
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL PROCEDURE CODE (CHAPTER 101)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      248.09,
      401.9,
      270.83
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      282.29,
      401.88,
      305.03
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Civil Procedure Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      316.49,
      401.91,
      362.03
    ],
    "text": "2. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 431 of the Civil Procedure Code(Chapter 101), and shall have effect as section 431A of thatCode:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      227.85,
      373.49,
      389.85,
      396.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201cD. -COMMISSIONS FOR MEDICALEXAMINATIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      407.69,
      401.91,
      498.83
    ],
    "text": "431A. (1) (a) Where the action is one fordamages for injury to person, the court shall,on application made by any party and subjectto such terms and conditions as it maydetermine, order the injured person to submithimself to medical examination by one or morebut not exceeding three medical practitioners,nominated by the court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      510.29,
      401.87,
      567.23
    ],
    "text": "(b) Upon such examination, the report shallbe submitted to court on or before such date asmay be specified. The court shall forthwithcause a copy of each such report to be servedon each of the parties.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      578.69,
      401.89,
      635.63
    ],
    "text": "(2) It shall be lawful for any party to anaction to have one or more medicalpractitioners of such party\u2019s choice to bepresent at such examination as an observer orobservers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      647.09,
      401.88,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) Where the injured person fails or refusesto comply with an order of court made under",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      317.59,
      451.29,
      355.46
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew section431A inChapter 101",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      408.19,
