  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      202.25,
      397.17,
      246.59
    ],
    "text": "subsection (1), the court shall be entitled todraw all such inferences against such person asin all the circumstances of the case can properlybe drawn by reason of such failure or refusal.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      257.33,
      397.16,
      290.63
    ],
    "text": "(4) Such report or reports may, withoutfurther proof be used as evidence of the factsstated therein at the trial:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      301.25,
      397.21,
      400.67
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, the court shall, on applicationmade by any party to the action and upon suchterms as to costs or otherwise as it maydetermine, order that the medical practitionerbe summoned and examined orally on anymatter arising from or in connection with thereport or any statement of fact therein or anyrelevant fact which is alleged by any party tohave been omitted therefrom.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      411.29,
      397.18,
      477.59
    ],
    "text": "(5) Every court shall, from time to time,prepare a list of medical practitioners residingin or engaged in the practice within thejurisdiction of such court, to whom an ordermay be made under subsection (1)(a) for amedical examination:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      488.33,
      397.2,
      554.63
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the court shall, prior tothe inclusion of the name of any medicalpractitioner in such list, make such inquiriesas may be necessary to ascertain the regularavailability of such medical practitioner toundertake such medical examination.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      565.25,
      397.19,
      620.63
    ],
    "text": "(6) For the purpose of this section, \u201cmedicalpractitioner\u201d means a medical practitionerregistered with the Sri Lanka Medical Councilestablished under the Medical Ordinance(Chapter 105).\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      631.25,
      450.44,
      671.42
    ],
